ion predicates and bounds are unchanged. Configuration-discovery follow-on reviews explicit supported families and synthetic fixture bindings; coordination properties and bounds are unchanged. Other unrecognized configuration families remain a manual-review boundary. Responsibility closure follow-on: reviewed full mapped source diff; one appended fixed formal suite, metadata evidence binding and feature documentation; reducer guards and prior properties retained. Source-derived closure graph has separate bounded proof; no native claims. Reachable-history admission uses the same graph interface, registered bytes and export checks; all earlier model categories and guards remain. Added unknown-kind and commented-graph refusal controls. Restoration-suspension adds bounded history and a fixed suite; existing predicates and admission guards are retained. Restoration integration source review: fixed suite appends one group; metadata adds one history binding; upkeep and local-assurance skill wording follows. Existing reducer, guards, graph, publication awaits, dispatch and delivery semantics unchanged. Registry order restored for pre-existing negative control; no behavior or earlier guards changed. Preload path repair changes only fixture import specifiers to encoded file URLs; mapped production predicates, guards, bounds and model semantics remain unchanged. Cooperative-cloud integration adds one reachable-reducer evidence binding and a fixed suite; existing coordination predicates, source guards and mutations are unchanged.",
